== saved and loaded as prla
saved
interface saved
     DeclareTypeClass Fci!K
     DeclareType Fci!T : Fci!K
     DeclareType Fci!U : Fci!K
     CondRewrite cr: Fci!ca => Fci!crr --> Fci!crc
     InputForm ifm: Fci!ifr <--> Fci!ifc
     Comment Fci!cm
     DeclareTypeRewrite Fci!U --> Fci!T
     DefineTerm Fci!dt : Fci!T = Fci!dv (opaque false)
     DForm dft: Fci!dfr = Fci!dfd parens
     DForm dfn: Fci!dfn no-def prec p
     MLRewrite mr: Fci!mrt def mrdef
     MLAxiom ma: Fci!mat def -
     PrecRel pl < pr
     Id 7
     Improve im public: imx
     MLGramUpd Infix +++
     SummaryItem si
     ToploopItem ti
     MagicBlock mb: mb1; mb2
